        "id": 1329040
      },
      "writtenOn": "2019-07-31T16:37:45Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Where do you think will be an apt location to initiate cable discovery in this situation?\n\nI can add a flag that checks if the cable responded before and avoid re-discovery again. But in the situation where the swap fails, this might not work.",
      "parentUuid": "89675f62_ffe64388",
      "range": {
